safe OwnedWal.cfg candidate-owned-wal 2g -
unsafe OwnedWalUnsafeSkipDrain.cfg candidate-owned-wal-drain 2g NoStaleRead
unsafe OwnedWalUnsafePausedClock.cfg candidate-owned-wal-clock 2g NoStaleRead
unsafe OwnedWalUnsafeLateGrant.cfg candidate-owned-wal-grant 2g NoStaleRead
unsafe OwnedWalUnsafeAckFromStart.cfg candidate-owned-wal-late-ack 2g AcknowledgedPrefixPreserved
unsafe OwnedWalUnsafeAckGap.cfg candidate-owned-wal-gap 2g AcknowledgedPrefixPreserved
unsafe OwnedWalUnsafeStaleRead.cfg candidate-owned-wal-missing 2g AcknowledgedPrefixPreserved
unsafe OwnedWalUnsafeRestartDrain.cfg candidate-owned-wal-restart 2g NoStaleRead
